{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "expr": "max by (testid, service, test_type) (k6_vus{testid=~\"$testid\"})",
        "hide": false,
        "iconColor": "rgba(255, 152, 48, 0.4)",
        "name": "k6 test runs",
        "step": "10s",
        "tagKeys": "testid,service,test_type",
        "textFormat": "{{service}} {{test_type}}",
        "titleFormat": "k6 run {{testid}}",
        "useValueForTime": false
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": false,
        "iconColor": "rgba(115, 191, 105, 1)",
        "name": "Run markers (selected run)",
        "target": {
          "limit": 200,
          "matchAny": false,
          "tags": ["cce-performance", "$testid"],
          "type": "tags"
        }
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": false,
        "hide": false,
        "iconColor": "rgba(184, 119, 217, 1)",
        "name": "Run markers (every run)",
        "target": {
          "limit": 200,
          "matchAny": false,
          "tags": ["cce-performance"],
          "type": "tags"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "What: the collector under load: k6 HTTP rate, latency, failures and dropped iterations next to the collector's received/accepted/duplicate/rejected counters, Kafka publishing, server-side time, DB pool, JVM and container. How: provisioned by monitoring/docker-compose.yml or imported into CCE's Grafana (monitoring/cce-grafana-import/README.md); pick the run in \"Run id\". Needs: DS_PROMETHEUS with k6 remote-write series (service=\"collector\") and the cce-collector-service scrape job. Outputs: nothing written; panels and run annotations only.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "asDropdown": true,
      "icon": "external link",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true,
      "tags": ["cce-performance"],
      "targetBlank": false,
      "title": "CCE Performance dashboards",
      "tooltip": "",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "url": ""
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "k6 → collector (HTTP POST /v1/events), filtered by Run id and Test type",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "How many HTTP requests k6 STARTED per second (k6 counter http_reqs, pushed by remote write). Tests use an open model: k6 starts requests at the configured arrival rate whether or not the service keeps up, so this line should be flat at the target rate. A dip below the target means k6 could not start requests on time (see dropped iterations). Split by HTTP status: anything other than 202 is a problem.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 4,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(k6_http_reqs_total{testid=~\"$testid\",service=~\"$service\",test_type=~\"$test_type\"}[30s]))",
          "legendFormat": "HTTP {{status}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "k6 HTTP requests per second, by status",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Time from k6 sending a request to receiving the full response, as seen by k6. p95 = 95 % of requests were faster than this. k6 exports these in SECONDS (multiplied by 1000 here) and calculates them from its own samples, so they can lag behind a sudden change; the run report's per-window numbers are the reference. Dashed line: the default pass limit HTTP_P95_LIMIT_MS = 500 ms (to be confirmed from UAT/Dev data; a run may override it). Only the collector has server-side times, and only avg/max (no histogram buckets exported).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 4,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "dashed"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 500
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "ms",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max(k6_http_req_duration_p95{testid=~\"$testid\",service=~\"$service\",test_type=~\"$test_type\"}) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max(k6_http_req_duration_p99{testid=~\"$testid\",service=~\"$service\",test_type=~\"$test_type\"}) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "k6 HTTP latency p95 / p99 (ms)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Share of HTTP requests that failed (k6 marks a response as failed when its status is not expected, or on a time-out / connection error). \"last 30 s\" is calculated from the request counter and reacts quickly; \"whole run so far\" is k6's own http_req_failed rate. Dashed line: HTTP_MAX_FAILED_RATE = 1 % (to be confirmed).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 4,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "dashed"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.01
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total{testid=~\"$testid\",service=~\"$service\",test_type=~\"$test_type\",expected_response=\"false\"}[30s])) / sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total{testid=~\"$testid\",service=~\"$service\",test_type=~\"$test_type\"}[30s]))",
          "legendFormat": "failed share (last 30 s)",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max(k6_http_req_failed_rate{testid=~\"$testid\",service=~\"$service\",test_type=~\"$test_type\"})",
          "legendFormat": "k6 http_req_failed (whole run so far)",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "k6 failed requests (share)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Iterations k6 should have started (open model) but could not, because all its virtual users were busy. A few are tolerated (MAX_DROPPED_RATE = 0.1 % of planned events, to be confirmed by the team). Many dropped iterations with LOW latency mean k6 itself is the limit (\"at least X/s, k6 limit\"), not the service; with HIGH latency the service is slow and k6 ran out of VUs waiting for it.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
